<Mod id="DF0E3C1A-E572-1868-FBE9-C58E0671151F" version="1.09">
	<Properties>
		<Name>Team PVP [COLOR:ResCultureLabelCS]次元破壁：星穹铁道[ENDCOLOR] 1.09</Name>
		<Description>这是以崩坏：星穹铁道世界观为背景的文明6模组整合包。</Description>
		<Teaser>愿此行，终抵群星</Teaser>
		<Authors>Pen, Pen，夏凉凉凉，夕墨岚, 千川白浪, 榊野木乃实，Kotomi，PhantomJ_M</Authors>
		<SpecialThanks>Anqing, HSbF6HSO3F, IthildinX, JiDong, Nea•baraja, Ophidy, SiQi, World·Dream, Yuni, 梦幻星尘羽，优妮酱</SpecialThanks>
